{"root":{"data":{"id":"dn1m0kwj34w0","created":1795337463948,"text":"中心主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1m0prul8g0","created":1795337474549,"text":"本体论"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1m10raewg0","created":1795337498459,"text":"本体是什么"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1m153xmps0","created":1795337507931,"text":"AI理解业务的语义层"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m0y93o8g0","created":1795337493006,"text":"为什么要用本体"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1m1q7dhj40","created":1795337553851,"text":"基于业务建模，为业务而服务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m1aew51k0","created":1795337519478,"text":"业务语义的体系管理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m2ti27r40","created":1795337639392,"text":"合理对接AI"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m2ziwsg00","created":1795337652504,"text":"让AI去理解业务，并参与业务动作？"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m27cpnmo0","created":1795337591180,"text":"本体论真正落地的目标"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1m2dufqj40","created":1795337605312,"text":"实现现实企业业务的数字孪生"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mkjzvco00","created":1795339029256,"text":"怎么落地"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mkmvyk540","created":1795339035550,"text":"三大原则"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mksku7ts0","created":1795339047938,"text":"基于（DDD）领域驱动设计"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mkziku5c0","created":1795339063039,"text":"不要创建重复实体"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mlb3vsh40","created":1795339088272,"text":"对扩展开放、组合优于继承"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mr6z56jk0","created":1795339549463,"text":"尽量不能基于数据物理表去直接做本体对象类型映射，意义不大"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mrwh2rvc0","created":1795339604967,"text":"没有"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1nc522hgw0","created":1795341190934,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1nnm2xhio0","created":1795342089997,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1nz3sir940","created":1795342990556,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mlo1a7400","created":1795339116413,"text":"方法步骤"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mm384r4g0","created":1795339149479,"text":"1、理解业务领域"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mm6en7eg0","created":1795339156403,"text":"2、设计本体模型体系"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mmagqfug0","created":1795339165236,"text":"3、映射数据源与逻辑"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mp2t3src0","created":1795339383663,"text":"对于经过治理的数据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mprq8vvc0","created":1795339437909,"text":"可直接基于数据中台进行建模"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mpfn73j40","created":1795339411604,"text":"没有经过治理的数据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mpiqw75c0","created":1795339418357,"text":"需要经过一些复杂的pipeline去完成处理"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mlvlj1so0","created":1795339132875,"text":"痛点难点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mmsgsj2g0","created":1795339204422,"text":"大部分业务现状都是业务数据表散乱、不规范，没有经过数据治理过的数据结构。所以数据和对象可能是比较难映射的。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mq1vnvaw0","created":1795339460005,"text":"项目实践"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mq6q1r4o0","created":1795339470549,"text":"高速项目"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mq9fcshs0","created":1795339476433,"text":"金租项目"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mqc9v4600","created":1795339482631,"text":"具体内容"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mqgzvhx40","created":1795339492911,"text":"开发对象实例图谱"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mqn3blsg0","created":1795339506180,"text":"智能问数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mqdodfko0","created":1795339485685,"text":"遇到问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1mqx95ilc0","created":1795339528301,"text":"业务数据表散乱、不规范，没有经过数据治理过的数据结构。所以数据和对象可能是比较难映射的。"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m0swvw680","created":1795337481383,"text":"智能体"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn6qi0ocbig0","created":1795857914695,"text":"项目实践"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn6qi7hqlcw0","created":1795857929533,"text":"金租项目"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn6qiafieu00","created":1795857935929,"text":"智能问数"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1m0vp3mn40","created":1795337487443,"text":"数据开发"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1mqqryy8o0","created":1795339514201,"text":"知识库"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}